heading>\\nIncomplete data!\\nThe infographics are based on incomplete technical data on the requirements of Trine 2. The data is calculated\\nbased on the minimum requirements only . We are working on collecting data.\\n<quark-table><table><thead><tr><th>Can play</th><th>Can't play</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>The percentage of players who can play Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution</td><td>4,043</td></tr><tr><td>Computer configuration fails system requirements</td><td>1,059</td></tr></tbody></table></quark-table>\\n79.2%\\nplayers can play Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution based on 5 102 user PC configurations + add yours\\n79.2% - The percentage of players who can play Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution\\n20.8% - Computer configuration fails system requirements\\n<quark-table><table><thead><tr><th>Can recommended</th><th>Cannot recommended</th></tr></thead></table></quark-table>\\n??%\\nwill play with comfortable graphic settings\\n??% - The percentage of players whose computer configuration meets the recommended requirements and allows them to run Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution with comfortable graphic settings\\n100% - The percentage of players whose PC configuration does not satisfy the recommended system requirements of Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution 79.2%\\nwill play only on lowest graphic settings\\n79.2% - The percentage of players who can run Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution only on the lowest video graphic settings\\n20.8% - The percentage of players whose PC configuration does not allow to play Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution 15.6%\\nmore accessible than other games\\n15.6% - The number of games is even more demanding than Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution, which makes it more accessible in comparison with other\\n84.4% - Games whose requirements are not as tough as in Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution\\nFind teammates in Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution\\nFind here the players for the co-op game in Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution. Join Species: Artificial Life, Real Evolution teammates, create groups and grow up to teams"}, "4": {"title": "在 Steam 上购买 生态系统 立省 50%", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1133120/Ecosystem/?curator_clanid=27270436", "page_content": "生态系统\\n生态系统\\n开发者\\nTom Johnson\\n发行商\\nSlug Disco\\n发行日期\\n2024 年 11 月 8 日\\n创造虚拟生命形态，其发展受到深度模拟进化的影响。引导它们在你建造的环境中战斗、交配和适应。预告片中的所有生物都是在游戏中自行进化的！\\n所有评测：\\n多半好评 (553) - 此游戏的 553 篇用户评测中有 77% 为好评。\\n发行日期:\\n2024 年 11 月 8 日\\n开发者:\\nTom Johnson\\n发行商:\\nSlug Disco\\n标签\\n该产品的热门用户自定义标签：\\n殖民模拟 模拟 沙盒 水底\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">鉴赏家评测</quark-heading>\\n推荐\\n由 SILENT's game research center 2021 年 3 月 20 日\\n“Ecosystem是一款高自由度的海底生态系统创造模拟游戏，游戏比较吸引我的一个是题材，我个人从小就比较喜欢跟海洋有关的东西，另一个是自定义系统，可不可以理解成海底版的《城市：天际线》？总之目前将要上线的是EA版本，估计内容还是有限，期待后面更加细化、内容更加充实的更新。\\n推荐指数：\\n🌕🌕🌕🌑🌑”\\n链接与信息\\n下载试用版\\n功能\\n单人\\nSteam 创意工坊\\nSteam 云\\n家庭共享\\n语言 :\\n简体中文及其他 5 种语言\\n添加到帐户\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">此游戏的内容 浏览所有 (2)</quark-heading>\\nEcosystem - Tropical Fish Pack\\n-10%\\n¥ 22.00\\n¥ 19.80\\nEcosystem Soundtrack\\n-10%\\n¥ 26.00\\n¥ 23.40\\n¥ 43.20\\n将所有 DLC 添加至购物车\\n浏览社区中心\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">关于此游戏</quark-heading>\\n《生态系统》是一款关于生命的游戏。其核心是不断进化的虚拟生命形式，它们从合成DNA中诞生并生长，生活在物理模拟的海洋中。这段DNA包含有关生物的一切信息：它们的骨架结构、思维处理器甚至是它们的战斗技能。\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">模拟</quark-heading>\\n虚拟生命形态的神经系统是一个线性计算机，在每一刻，来自感觉器官的数据通过一系列神经元最终传递到身体特定部位的肌肉。生物游泳的方式就像真实的海洋生物一样，它们通过在关节处施加扭矩以协调推动自己前进的方式来推动水流。\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">进化</quark-heading>\\n要创造生命，你只需释放一批具有随机大脑和身体的生命形态到水中。它们大多数会毫无目的地挣扎，但那些能设法稍微移动的个体将比其他生物拥有更多的后代。十代之后，它们的后代将成为极具天赋的游泳者。\\n看到这些生物在你的模拟世界中进行真实地进化，接收你手把手的引导，确实令人满足。\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">战斗</quark-heading>"}, "5": {"title": "Video Game Allows Users to \"Play God\" With Evolution | Answers in Genesis", "url": "https://answersingenesis.org/reviews/video-game-allows-users-to-play-god-with-evolution/?srsltid=AfmBOopUqC7ZO_154nBGchIoFdJCiAX9ElDLLxRD3SGO7GH_26HMhFfo", "page_content": "Washington Post : “In the Beginning, Finally” It’s a video game that gives you your very own universe and lets you “play god”—so what’s the story of this latest venue for evolution?\\nThis week, video game publisher Electronic Arts released Spore , a wide-ranging video game that lets the player fill in for\\nGod —using a distorted imitation of theistic\\nevolution .\\nThe game allows players to design creatures that then compete to survive. Designed by Will Wright, creator of the popular video game The Sims , Spore has the player manage the evolution of a species from puddle-surfing protozoan all the way up to interplanetary-sailing intelligent life. Of course, random chance doesn’t guide the player’s species; rather, the game allows players to design creatures that then compete to survive. “The game’s powerful design tools allow players to follow their imaginations and create a giant race of friendly-looking teddy bears, if they like, or monsters that look as if they might have been plucked from a horror movie,” the Post ’s Mike Musgrove notes. He also explains the basic operation of the game:\\nAs a species begins to thrive, players earn “DNA points” that can be spent on developing better versions of next-generation creatures. A certain type of leg or foot might make a player’s creature run faster or jump higher. The development options a player is shown are based on his or her previous rounds of choices; that teddy-bear species wouldn't be able to quickly evolve into a two-headed-snake species, in other words. . . . [T]here isn’t exactly a way to “win” the game. As a player’s pet species develops the technology to venture into space, Spore users can keep exploring the virtual universe for as long as they wish."}, "6": {"title": "物种人造生命真实进化下载-物种人造生命真实进化中文版下载_3DM单机", "url": "https://dl.3dmgame.com/pc/137744.html", "page_content": "<quark-ocr>SPECIES ARTIFICIALLIFE REALEVOLUTION</quark-ocr></quark-image>\\n游戏类型： 模拟经营 开发厂商： Quasar\\n更新时间： 2024-12-20 发售日期： 2018年9月28日\\n游戏平台： 